        "text_EkYUVM": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>At Astroaura, we value your trust and<br/>strive to provide you with authentic, high-quality gemstones, rudraksha,<br/>crystals, jewellery, and spiritual products.</p><h2>1. Eligibility for Returns & Replacement</h2><p>Eligible reasons for return or<br/>replacement:<br/>  • Product damaged during transit.<br/><br/>  • Incorrect product delivered.<br/><br/>  • Defective product upon receipt.</p><p>- Conditions:<br/>  • Must be reported within seven (7) days of delivery.<br/>  • Items must be unused, unaltered, and in original packaging, with all tags, certificates, and seals intact.<br/>  • Products that have been tampered<br/>with, resized, customized, worn, or altered will not be accepted.<br/><br/>- Proof requirement:<br/>  • Customers must provide videographic proof at the time of unboxing to validate the return or replacement claim.<br/><br/>  • Without such proof, the return/exchange request will not be processed.</p><p>- Exclusions:<br/>  • Requests made after 7 days of delivery.<br/>  • Courier charges, VAT, and duties are non-refundable.<br/>  • The customer is responsible for<br/>return shipping costs.</p><h2>2. Non-Returnable & Non-Refundable Items</h2><p>The following categories are not eligible for return/replacement unless damaged or incorrect on arrival:<br/><br/>• Customized jewellery or made-to-order items (including rings/bracelets made to size)<br/>• Beads bracelets<br/>• Crystal trees<br/>• Rakhi<br/>• Products received exactly as ordered<br/>• Sale, discounted, or clearance items (final sale)</p><h2>3. Refund Process</h2><p>If your return request is approved, then<br/>your refund will be processed and credited to your credit card or<br/>original/source method of payment, within 12–15 working days, subject to<br/>unforeseeable delays from bank processes and/or public holidays, if applicable.  Once your return is received and duly inspected by our team, we will send you an email to notify you acknowledging that we have received your returned item.<br/>We will also notify you of the approval or rejection of your refund based on<br/>our internal inspection.<br/>Important Notes:<br/>- Refunds will only be processed to the original source of payment. This policy<br/>is in place to comply with applicable legal requirements and to avoid any<br/>potential legal or penal consequences. Refunds will not be transferred to any<br/>alternate bank account, card, or payment method.<br/><br/>- For orders placed using the Cash on Delivery (COD) payment method:<br/><br/>  • The Company reserves the right to<br/>request additional details including, but not limited to, PAN Card for orders<br/>above INR 2,00,000.<br/><br/>  • To ensure compliance, the Customer<br/>agrees to provide the necessary bank details, including but not limited to a<br/>copy of a cancelled cheque, passbook details, or any other information required for processing the refund.<br/><br/>  • Refunds will only be processed if the details provided — including the customer’s name and address at the time of the order placement — match the information on record.<br/>  • Failure to provide accurate and<br/>matching details may result in an inability to process the refund.<br/><br/>- For prepaid orders made via Credit Card, Debit Card, or Net Banking, the<br/>refunded amount will be credited back to the original account within 12–15<br/>working days.<br/><br/>- Notwithstanding anything contained herein, the Company will make reasonable efforts to process and issue refunds promptly. However, the Customer acknowledges and agrees that any delays in processing the refund due to circumstances beyond the Company's control — including but not limited to technical issues, third-party service delays, or other unforeseen events — shall not be the responsibility of the Company. The Customer agrees to allow reasonable time for the completion of the refund process.</p><h2>4. Return/Replacement Process</h2><p>1. Initiation: Contact<br/>support@astroaura.market within 7 days of receipt, with order ID and proof<br/>(photo/video).<br/><br/>2. Approval: Wait for written confirmation from our team before shipping back<br/>any product.<br/><br/>3. Shipping: Ship the product at your cost, with proper documentation for<br/>customs (in case of international returns).<br/><br/>4. Inspection: Product will be examined by our quality team.<br/><br/>5. Refund/Replacement: If approved, refund/replacement will be processed within<br/>the stated timelines.</p><h2>5. Authenticity & Quality Guarantee</h2><p>- Authenticity: Every product sold on<br/>Astroaura is lab-certified and sourced from trusted suppliers.<br/>- Quality: Each product is carefully inspected and energized before dispatch.<br/>- Disclaimer: Effectiveness of gemstones, crystals, or spiritual products is based on belief systems and varies by individual. No guaranteed outcomes are promised.</p><h2>6. Exclusions from Refunds/Exchanges</h2><p>- Change of Mind: If the customer no longer wants the product.<br/>- Minor Packaging Defects: Cosmetic packaging issues.<br/>- Slight Variations: Minor differences in color, size, or texture due to<br/>natural characteristics of stones or screen resolution.</p><h2>7. Cancellation Policy</h2><p>- Orders, once placed, cannot be cancelled.<br/>- For COD orders, refusal to accept delivery will be treated as cancellation,<br/>and future orders may be restricted.</p><h2>8. International Orders</h2><p>- Duties, VAT, customs, and clearance<br/>charges are the customer’s responsibility.<br/>- If shipment is refused or cancelled after dispatch, all return-related<br/>charges will be deducted from the refund.<br/>- Refunds processed only upon receipt of returned goods.</p><h2>9. Late or Missing Refunds</h2><p>- If refund not received:<br/>• First check with your bank/credit card company.<br/>• Processing may take additional time<br/>due to banking cycles.<br/><br/>- If still not received, email us at support@astroaura.market with transaction<br/>details.</p><h2>10. Contact Information</h2><p>For all refund, return, or exchange<br/>queries:<br/>Email: support@astroaura.market<br/>Working Hours: Monday – Saturday, 10 AM – 7 PM (IST)</p>"
